ock Revival","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":17,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos"},{"id":97251168075267,"type":"genre","name":"New New Wave","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos"}],"album_genres":[{"id":110103737021637,"type":"genre","name":"New Rave","n":3},{"id":226054802434556,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Punk","n":1},{"id":203327676944608,"type":"genre","name":"Bloghouse","n":1},{"id":158601647791242,"type":"genre","name":"Dance-Punk Revival","n":1},{"id":40264566616896,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Punk Revival","n":1},{"id":8412226417108,"type":"genre","name":"Indie Rock","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":109586776832844,"name":"Renacimiento neopostpunk","book":"Postpunk. Romper todo y empezar de nuevo","author":"Simon Reynolds","start":2000,"end":2005,"desc":"Con el nuevo milenio, hipsters hastiados de las discotecas buscan tensión en lugar de catarsis: reediciones de Cabaret Voltaire, Throbbing Gristle, 23 Skidoo, ESG, DNA y Scritti Politti, clubes de punk funk y electropop, reuniones de Gang of Four y Mission of Burma, las películas 24 Hour Party People y Control, y bandas como The Rapture, LCD Soundsystem, Franz Ferdinand, Interpol, Liars, !!!, Wolf Eyes y Bloc Party. Dominan las inflexiones de la militancia postpunk, pero no su compromiso: lo más valioso de aquella época era su fe en el cambio, «que la música podía importar tanto».","color":"#fb7185","family":"Vanguardia postpunk: dub, funk y política","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/Postpunk/#neo-postpunk"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"London Origins (1999) in Post-Britpop","body":"Bloc Party emerged from London in 1999, positioning themselves within the post-Britpop movement alongside bands like Coldplay and the Kaiser Chiefs. \"Block Party came out of London beginning in 1999, making the part of the post-Brit Pop World that included other bands like Coldplay, the Kaiser Chiefs and a bunch of others.\"","year":1999,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Breakthrough via Franz Ferdinand","body":"The band achieved its significant break around 2003 when frontman Kele Okereke gave a demo tape to Alex Kapranos, the singer of Franz Ferdinand, at one of their shows. \"Block Party got their big break when Kelly went to a France Ferdinand show and gave a tape to singer Alex Capranos. That would be about 2003.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Early UK Awards Success","body":"Early in their career, Bloc Party garnered multiple awards in the UK, indicating their rapid recognition and impact. \"Block Party won a bunch of awards in the UK early on...\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Mark Rankin's Production Work","body":"Bloc Party's music benefited from the production work of Mark Rankin, contributing to his fame and expertise in the field. \"trabajo de producción que había hecho con Block Party.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Queens of The Stone Age  - Villains (información y reseña)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EyxGTW1j85I"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Modern \"New Wave\" Application for Rock Revival","body":"In the United States, the term \"New Wave\" was also extensively used to refer to a new interpretation of Rock Revival music, with Bloc Party being one of the bands cited as an example. This highlights the term's adaptability for describing contemporary artists reinterpreting classic rock sounds. \"o blogpartito a estas bandas que hacían esta nueva reinterpretación del Rock River.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Que es el New Wave","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxaTsoSRXZE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Part of 2000s Post-Punk Revival","body":"Bloc Party emerged as part of the new generation of bands in the 2000s Post-Punk revival, where Joy Division's influence was significant. \"Luego en el 2000 tuvimos ese nuevo rival del Post Punk en el que salían, pues, blockparti en el que salían los editoros, en el que salían todas estas bandas de la nueva generación del rival del Post Punk.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Especial JOY DIVISION: 4. La banda tras el final","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5DddiWrUbA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Part of New Rock Wave","body":"Bloc Party was one of the many groups that emerged during the new wave of Rock Revival music. \"tenemos a Bloque Party, tenemos a muchos grupos que nacieron un poco en torno a esa nueva oleada del Rock.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Arctic Monkeys: Cómo nació un mito.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t7SqB6i2xzE"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Shortlist Music Prize (2005) — Silent Alarm","body":"Nominated.","year":2005,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7502207"}]}],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Frontman of Bloc Party","body":"Kele Okereke is the frontman of the British band Bloc Party. \"Kelly O'Kareki, the frontman of the excellent British band Block Party.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Kele Okereke","from_id":254052150630130,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Genre-Blurring Approach","body":"Bakar's musical style intentionally blurs the lines between rap, indie rock, rock, and various other genres, an approach compared to Bloc Party. \"Since then, his whole thing has been to blur the lines between rap, indie rock, rock, and any number of other genres. In some senses, he's doing a lot of the same sort of thing as Block Party.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Bakar","from_id":81590101552935,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Kele Okereke's Feud","body":"Kele Okereke, frontman of Bloc Party, engaged in a public feud with Oasis, highlighting rivalries within the British music scene. \"it was fun to watch Kelly's feud with Oasis. He really didn't know them in our regard.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Oasis","from_id":21712155454134,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Part of Post-Britpop World","body":"Coldplay is mentioned as being part of the post-Britpop musical landscape that also included bands like Bloc Party and the Kaiser Chiefs. \"making the part of the post-Brit Pop World that included other bands like Coldplay, the Kaiser Chiefs and a bunch of others.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Coldplay","from_id":253536955654314,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Part of Post-Britpop World","body":"The Kaiser Chiefs are mentioned as being part of the post-Britpop musical landscape that also included bands like Bloc Party and Coldplay. \"making the part of the post-Brit Pop World that included other bands like Coldplay, the Kaiser Chiefs and a bunch of others.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"The Kaiser Chiefs","from_id":14162958998418,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Role in Bloc Party's Breakthrough","body":"Franz Ferdinand's singer, Alex Kapranos, played an unwitting role in Bloc Party's big break when Kele Okereke handed him a demo tape at a show around 2003. \"Block Party got their big break when Kelly went to a France Ferdinand show and gave a tape to singer Alex Capranos. That would be about 2003.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Franz Ferdinand","from_id":156020055156537,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Diversity Show 2021","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdCAjFW04Oc"}]}],"charts":[{"id":265854359067142,"type":"album","name":"Silent Alarm","work_year":2005,"list_id":44735175437010,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 2000s","src":"charts","rank":271,"year":2005,"note":null,"yt":"ZLEMgOyYWnc","scaruffi":null},{"id":114467519592166,"type":"album","name":"Silent Alarm Remixed","list_id":114210912583554,"list":"RYM Top — Dance — New Rave","src":"musthear","rank":83,"year":2005,"note":null,"yt":"_p8T7JT8LK0","scaruffi":null},{"id":265854359067142,"type":"album","name":"Silent Alarm","list_id":89365250498738,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Indie Rock","src":"musthear","rank":165,"year":2005,"note":null,"yt":"ZLEMgOyYWnc","scaruffi":null},{"id":265854359067142,"type":"album","name":"Silent Alarm","list_id":182218712006755,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk","src":"musthear","rank":87,"year":2005,"note":null,"yt":"ZLEMgOyYWnc","scaruffi":null},{"id":265854359067142,"type":"album","name":"Silent Alarm","list_id":257211158273009,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk Revival","src":"musthear","rank":7,"year":2005,"note":null,"yt":"ZLEMgOyYWnc","scaruffi":null},{"id":182691795149052,"type":"song","name":"Two More Years","work_year":2005,"list_id":31534136941543,"list":"Triple J Hottest 100 · 2005","src":"singles","rank":23,"year":2005,"note":"United K